@startuml command_pattern

skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title Command Pattern Architecture (Polymorphic Commands)

package "Command Interfaces" {
    interface IGameCommand {
        + {abstract} Execute(StateManager& manager): void
    }

    interface IEntityCommand {
        + {abstract} Execute(Entity& entity): void
    }
    class PushStateCommand {
        - stateManager: StateManager*
        - stateToPush: unique_ptr<GameState>
        + Execute(): void
    }

    class PopStateCommand {
        - stateManager: StateManager*
        + Execute(): void
    }

    class MoveCommand {
        - player: Player*
        - direction: Vector2
        + Execute(): void
    }

    class JumpCommand {
        - player: Player*
        + Execute(): void
    }

    class UseAbilityCommand {
        - player: Player*
        - abilityIndex: int
        + Execute(): void
    }
}

IGameCommand <|.. PushStateCommand
IGameCommand <|.. PopStateCommand

IEntityCommand <|.. MoveCommand
IEntityCommand <|.. JumpCommand
IEntityCommand <|.. UseAbilityCommand

note right of IGameCommand
  Lệnh điều khiển GameState (Menu, Chơi, Pause)
end note

note right of IEntityCommand
  Lệnh điều khiển hành động của nhân vật/quái vật
end note



@enduml
